This directory contains lectures and accomanying materials for the Econometric
Society Monograph to be published by Cambridge University Press:

   Measuring Business Productivity and Value
   by Ellen McGrattan

The subdirectories are the individual lectures


  ./GrilichesDataWoes

  ./MacroDataTheory
  ./ComputeGrowthModel
  ./AnalyzeModelAccounts
  ./BusinessCycleAccounting
  ./MeasuringProductivityValue

  ./AddIntellectualProperty
  ./MacroDataTheoryWithIPP
  ./ComputeModelWithIPP
  ./AnalyzeModelWithIPP
  ./MeasuringProductivityIPPValue

  ./AddSweatEquity
  ./MacroDataTheoryWithSweat
  ./ComputeModelWithSweat
  ./AnalyzeModelWithSwat
  ./MeasuringProductivitySweatValue

  ./Epilogue

  ./Appendix


Main punchlines for the Preface, Parts I-III, Epilogue
   Preface:  Griliches data woes from large unresolved residual
   Part I-III: 
       -- Griliches was witnessing start of a puzzling tech boom
       -- Needed to extend theory and data to resolve puzzles
       -- Now private pass-through is the main unmeasured sector
   Epilogue: Deja vu with AI
  
